{"content":"💡 **SUGGESTION: doc charset for `HERDR_PANE_ID` omits the colon**

This line says the pane id is charset-valid as `[A-Za-z0-9._-]+`, but the implemented gate (`herdr_reporter.dart` `_idPattern = ^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+$`) also accepts `:`. Since herdr's real ids are `window:pane`, the doc undersells the accepted set — and disagrees with the "colon required" framing used everywhere else (PR description, `validPaneId` doc comment). Suggest aligning the doc with the code: `` `[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+` ``.
